Muse
====

This work is a modified version of PI-Desktop.

    Upstream project : PI-Desktop
    Upstream source  : https://github.com/vastsa/PI-Desktop
    Upstream author  : vastsa <hhxk666@gmail.com> and PI-Desktop contributors
    Upstream license : GNU Lesser General Public License v3.0 or later

Muse is a rebranded fork. The modifications consist of renaming the product and
its identifiers — application id, package scope, crate binary, environment
variable prefixes, plugin ids, storage paths, packaging artifact names, and the
associated user-facing strings and documentation. Functional behaviour is
unchanged from the upstream commit this fork was taken from.

